<style>@page Section1 { size: 595.3pt 841.9pt; margin: 36pt 32pt; } div.Section1 { page: Section1; } table { border-collapse: collapse; }</style></head>
<body><div class="Section1"><div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;"><div style="border-bottom:2px solid #212d51;padding-bottom:10px;margin-bottom:14px;">
    <div style="font:bold 11px Arial;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#17b9e4;">Interim payment application</div>
    <div style="font:bold 20px Arial;color:#212d51;margin-top:4px;">Residential Tower — G+2P+12</div>
    <div style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;color:#6a7590;margin:2px 0 0;">PRJ-0001 · IPA-01 · 4 Oct 2026</div></div>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">To: Consulting Engineer<br>From: Contracting Company LLC<br>Date: 4 Oct 2026</p>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;"><b>Subject: Interim Payment Application No. 1 — work to 4 Oct 2026</b></p>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">We submit our interim payment application No. 1 for the period 4 Sep 2026 to 4 Oct 2026, in the net amount of <b>AED 30,627,000.00</b>, plus VAT of AED 1,531,350.00, a total of <b>AED 32,158,350.00</b>. The valuation of every item of the Bill of Quantities, the statements and the supporting documents listed below are enclosed.</p>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">We request your certificate within 28 days of receipt, in accordance with the Contract.</p>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">1. Summary</h2>
<table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:4px 0 8px;">
  <tr><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;"></th><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;text-align:right;">Amount (AED)</th></tr>
  <tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Contract sum</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">80,000,000.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Work done to date</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">34,030,000.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Approved variations to date</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">0.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Materials on site</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">0.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;"><b>Gross valuation to date</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;"><b>34,030,000.00</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Less retention (10%, capped at 4,000,000.00)</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">(3,403,000.00)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Less advance payment recovered to date</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">(0.00)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;"><b>Total due to date</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;"><b>30,627,000.00</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">Less total certified on the previous certificate</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">(0.00)</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;"><b>Net amount of this application</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;"><b>30,627,000.00</b></td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">VAT 5%</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">1,531,350.00</td></tr><tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;"><b>Total payable including VAT</b></td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;"><b>32,158,350.00</b></td></tr></table>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;color:#6a7590;">Work done is 42.54% of the contract sum. The complete valuation is in the enclosed Excel file.</p>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">2. Previous applications and certificates</h2>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">This is the first application.</p>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">3. Retention and advance payment</h2>
<table style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:4px 0 8px;">
  <tr><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;">Ref</th><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;text-align:right;">Retention to date</th><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;text-align:right;">This application</th><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;text-align:right;">Advance recovered to date</th><th style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;background:#212d51;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;text-align:right;">This application</th></tr>
  <tr><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;">IPA-01</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">3,403,000.00</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">3,403,000.00</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">0.00</td><td style="border:1px solid #d0d7e2;padding:6px 8px;font:13px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;vertical-align:top;text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;">0.00</td></tr></table>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">4. Variations</h2>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">No variations are claimed in this application.</p>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">5. Materials on site</h2>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">No materials on site are claimed in this application.</p>
<h2 style="font:bold 15px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#212d51;margin:22px 0 8px;">6. Inspections approved in the period</h2>
<p style="font:13px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1b2437;margin:0 0 8px;">No inspection requests were approved in the period.</p>
